    "Frames": "帧",
    "A target's description does not give its internal RAM. Read a board in Live and it is measured against what the board has.": "目标的描述中没有内部 RAM 大小。在“实时”中读取开发板后，将以开发板的实际容量进行比较。",
    "Internal RAM is the heap the board reported in Live. The board's own system takes the rest of its RAM.": "内部 RAM 是开发板在“实时”中报告的堆。其余 RAM 由开发板自身的系统占用。",
