    "Objects": "对象",
    "Components": "组件",
    "Own": "自身",
    "Own is the object and its components as this editor lays them out; on a 32-bit board they are smaller. What a component allocates when the game runs (a particle pool, a text cache) shows in Live. Assets counts each asset the object uses in full, though objects share them.": "“自身”是对象及其组件在本编辑器中的大小，在 32 位开发板上会更小。组件在游戏运行时分配的内存（粒子池、文本缓存）显示在“实时”中。“资源”按全量计算对象使用的每个资源，但对象之间会共享它们。",
    "Everything here is an estimate, worked out from the scene and the target without running it. Live shows what a running game measures.": "此处所有数值都是估算，由场景和目标计算得出，未实际运行。运行中游戏的实测值显示在“实时”中。",
    "Source": "来源",
    "Play mode in this editor": "本编辑器的播放模式",
    "Board on %s": "%s 上的开发板",
    "Since Play Started": "自播放开始",
    "The editor runs the game in its own process, so the edit scene's memory is there too. Since Play Started leaves it out.": "编辑器在自身进程中运行游戏，因此编辑场景的内存也在其中。“自播放开始”会将其排除。",
    "Not playing: this is the editor's own scene. Press Play to measure the game.": "未在播放：这是编辑器自己的场景。按“播放”以测量游戏。",
    "Asks the board over its serial port every two seconds while Auto is on. Close the Serial Monitor first if it has the port open.": "“自动”开启时，每两秒通过串口询问一次开发板。如果串口监视器占用了该端口，请先关闭它。",
    "Asking the board...": "正在询问开发板...",
    "Regions": "区域",
    ", peak %s": "，峰值 %s",
    ", %s free": "，空闲 %s",
    ", lowest %s": "，最低 %s",
    "The first figure is what the engine placed; peak is the most it held at once. Free, lowest and the size come from the heap and also cover what the engine does not place: containers, the board's own system.": "第一个数值是引擎分配的内存；峰值是同时占用的最大量。空闲、最低和大小来自堆，也包括引擎未分配的部分：容器、开发板自身的系统。",
    "By Category": "按类别",
    "No call sites: this build strips them (DEKI_STRIP_ALLOC_CONTEXT), or its firmware is older than the memory report.": "没有调用位置：此构建去掉了它们（DEKI_STRIP_ALLOC_CONTEXT），或其固件早于内存报告功能。",
    "What": "内容",
    "Blocks": "块",
    "Now": "当前",
    "Peak": "峰值",
    "Other call sites": "其他调用位置",
    "Measured by call site: each place in the code that allocates through the engine, grouped by the file it is in. A category's peak adds up its call sites' peaks, which need not have come at the same time.": "按调用位置实测：代码中每个通过引擎分配内存的位置，按所在文件分组。类别的峰值是其各调用位置峰值之和，这些峰值不一定同时出现。",
